"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs","description":"Open5GS is a C-language Open Source implementation for 5G Core and EPC, i.e. the core network of LTE/NR network (Release-19)","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/deployments","created_at":"2017-02-01T10:48:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T03:05:54Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-05T00:20:37Z","git_url":"git://github.com/open5gs/open5gs.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:open5gs/open5gs.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs","homepage":"https://open5gs.org","size":88373,"stargazers_count":2803,"watchers_count":2803,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1152,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":348,"license":{"key":"agpl-3.0","name":"GNU Affero General Public License v3.0","spdx_id":"AGPL-3.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/agpl-3.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["3gpp","4g","5g","5gc","core","epc","lte","network","nr","open5gs"],"visibility":"public","forks":1152,"open_issues":348,"watchers":2803,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/pulls/4895","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/pull/4895","diff_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/pull/4895.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/pull/4895.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\nAfter a UPF restart, `pfcp_restoration()` re-establishes every PFCP session of that UPF, including sessions whose release is already under way and sessions that a newer session of the UE has replaced. They are installed again with their old UE IP address and later removed by the SMF without a PFCP Session Deletion, leaving stale sessions in the UPF (#4892). TS 23.527 clause 4.3.2 leaves the choice of sessions to restore to the SMF; this patch restores only the operational session that is current for its PDU session ID (5GC) or APN and RAT type (EPC).\n\n## Field motivation\n\nReported in #4892 (downlink for a re-used UE IP address reaching a stale session). Reproduced in our lab: UPF killed, both PDU sessions of a UE released by the SMF and left unanswered by the UE, UPF restarted - before the patch the restarted UPF received a PFCP Session Establishment Request for each released session.\n\n## Fix\n\n- New helper `restoration_wanted()` in `src/smf/pfcp-sm.c`: skips sessions not in `smf_gsm_state_operational` and sessions that are no longer the current one for their identity (`smf_sess_find_by_psi()` / `smf_sess_find_by_apn()`), with a warning naming the session.\n- `pfcp_restoration()` calls it before building the restoration request; nothing else changes.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nThe release of the skipped sessions continues as today; their PFCP state in the UPF is not touched (the restarted UPF has none). Heartbeat handling and the release on heartbeat loss are unchanged.\n\n## Closes / Refs\n\n- Refs #4892\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `ninja -C build` clean against `main @ 310fea94e` (-Werror); existing suites vonr, handover, registration, attach pass.\n- [x] Lab: UPF killed, sessions released and unanswered, UPF restarted - the restarted UPF receives no PFCP Session Establishment Request for them (abts case in our tree; harness needs per-NF process control).\n- [ ] Not yet run: UPF restart with operational sessions - all restored as before (maintainers' smoke test welcome).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4895/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/6306992248","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4892#issuecomment-6306992248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4892","id":6306992248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM8AAAABd-0QeA","user":{"login":"zhangerfei-dp","id":334437229,"node_id":"U_kgDOE-8bbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334437229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangerfei-dp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T03:04:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T03:04:40Z","body":"Follow-up from the reporter: a proposed fix is open as #4895, and we have now measured it against this report on the same rig.\n\nWe can reproduce the stale-PDR condition deterministically. Freeze the UEs so the N1/N2 release cannot complete, bounce the UPF across the heartbeat give-up window, then start it again - at restoration time every session is still mid-release:\n\n- **without the fix**: restoration re-installs all 8 sessions, and every downlink PDR key in the UPF is a pre-outage UE address (`10.64.0.30/.31/.200/.201`, `10.65.0.30/.31/.200/.201`). After the UEs return with new addresses the table holds 12 keys - the 8 stale ones plus the current 4. That is the state in this report.\n- **with #4895**: all 8 are skipped (`Skip restoration: session not operational`), the UPF receives no Session Establishment Request for them, and the table only ever contains current addresses.\n\nWe also checked the other direction, since it is the behaviour that has to survive: restarting the UPF while the sessions are still operational restores all 8, with PDR keys matching the UE addresses exactly - no regression.\n\nWorth noting for anyone reading this later: in a normal `restart upf` where the UEs answer the release quickly, the sessions are already gone before restoration runs and no stale entry appears; the failure needs the release to still be in flight. That is why it looks intermittent and why it is easy to misattribute to the NIC (we did, see #4892's original analysis).\n\nOur belt-and-braces guard stays in place regardless: a readiness check that compares the UPF session addresses against the UE tun addresses, which is what caught this in the first place.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/6306992248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zhangerfei-dp","id":334437229,"node_id":"U_kgDOE-8bbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334437229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangerfei-dp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://a